    <published>2026-08-26T00:00:00+09:00</published>
    <updated>2026-08-26T00:00:00+09:00</updated><author><name>행정안전부</name></author><category term="living"/>
    <summary type="text">노인복지법 제31조에 따라 노인복지시설을 설치·운영하기 위해 부동산을 취득하는 경우, 행정안전부에서 지방세를 2026년 12월 31일까지 감면해 주는 제도입니다.</summary>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <title type="text">노인복지 민간단체 지원</title>
    <link href="https://adk24211.github.io/walapp/support/living/%EB%85%B8%EC%9D%B8%EB%B3%B5%EC%A7%80-%EB%AF%BC%EA%B0%84%EB%8B%A8%EC%B2%B4-%EC%A7%80%EC%9B%90/" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
    <id>https://adk24211.github.io/walapp/support/living/%EB%85%B8%EC%9D%B8%EB%B3%B5%EC%A7%80-%EB%AF%BC%EA%B0%84%EB%8B%A8%EC%B2%B4-%EC%A7%80%EC%9B%90/</id>
    <published>2026-08-26T00:00:00+09:00</published>
    <updated>2026-08-26T00:00:00+09:00</updated><author><name>보건복지부</name></author><category term="living"/>
